Description: Go game with built-in AI and LAN play
 Weiqi (围棋) is a desktop Go game featuring a built-in AI opponent,
 local two-player LAN games with automatic room discovery, and
 in-game text chat. It supports 9x9, 13x13 and 19x19 boards with
 Chinese area scoring, ko rules, passing, resignation and scoring.
